<title>POLAND: STALPRODUKT JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</title>
<headline>STALPRODUKT JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.6 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.57 vs   1.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.01 vs   2.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.00 vs   2.08</p>
<p> Sales		   35.17 vs  27.02</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY	   1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     6.49 vs  12.44</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	10.09 vs  17.81</p>
<p> Operating profit    13.29 vs  17.71</p>
<p> Sales		  206.00 vs 172.39</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel products maker is</p>
<p>Stalprodukt SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
